      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me out? im writing a quick memo for my supervisor about the recent push for new antitrust laws targeting big tech companies like google and apple. can u just give me a summary of the main arguments for why the government should step in and regulate them more strictly? i need to make sure i have the core points right for the 'pro-regulation' section of my report.",
